(1 items) 1 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Jobs near me Assistant Professor of Law 10004518 On Site Arlington, VA Antonin Scalia Law School Instructional Faculty The primary purpose of law faculty is to provide effective teaching to Juris Doctor students, produce original scholarly works for publication, and provide service including leadership, through participation in governance, and operational or development activities in the Law School, the University, and/or the legal profession. Additionally, in accordance with ABA law school accreditation standards, the law faculty shares with the Dean the primary responsibility and authority for planning, implementing, and administering the program of legal education, selection, retention, promotion, and tenure of faculty, and determining educational policy. Read more Undergraduate Recruitment and Engagement Specialist 10004516 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Costello College of Business Classified Staff The Costello College of Business at George Mason University invites applications for the position of Undergraduate Recruitment and Engagement Specialist. Read more Intelligence Analyst 10004519 On Site Washington, D.C. Col of Humanities and Soc Science Research Staff Intelligence Analyst supporting the W/B HIDTA by collecting, analyzing, and producing criminal intelligence to generate investigative leads, identify trends, and assist law enforcement partners across the region. Read more Senior Director of Digital Engagement, Marketing, and Communications 10004527 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Advancement and Alumni Relations Administrative or Professional Faculty Closing on: Sep 21 2026 Reporting to the Associate VP, the Senior Director leads and provides strategic and creative direction for Advancement's digital engagement, integrated marketing, creative strategy, channel planning, audience activation, written communications and digital content across web, email, social media, texting, digital fundraising, direct marketing, and emerging platforms.\n\nThe position provides leadership for digital communication planning, graphic and multimedia content development, audience segmentation, marketing operations, and performance measurement, helping ensure Advancement communications reach the right audiences through coordinated channels, compelling visual presentation, strong creative execution, and measurable results. Read more Research Poster Printing Assistant 10004523 On Site Fairfax, VA Library Part-Time / Hourly Wage Closing on: Sep 12 2026 Join our team at Fenwick Library! We are looking for a friendly and reliable part-time assistant to provide courteous and professional assistance to library patrons. The position supports a few areas within Access Services. Read more Director, Athletics Annual Fund 10004434 On Site Fairfax, VA Intercollegiate Athletics Administrative or Professional Faculty Reporting to the Senior Associate Athletic Director for Development, the Director, Athletics Annual Fund provides strategic leadership and direction for George Mason Athletics’ comprehensive annual giving program and the Patriot Club. The Director leads the development and implementation of strategies designed to acquire new donors, retain and upgrade current supporters, re-engage lapsed donors, increase unrestricted and sport-specific giving, and strengthen the pipeline of prospective major-gift donors. This position establishes the annual fund’s fiscal-year plan, revenue and participation goals, performance metrics, donor segmentation strategies, communications and solicitation calendar, benefits structure, stewardship strategy, and overall donor experience. The Director provides leadership to the annual fund team, maintains a portfolio of leadership annual giving prospects, leads Athletics parent and family giving strategy, and collaborates with Athletics Major Gifts, Central Advancement, coaches, volunteers, and campus partners to align fundraising priorities and facilitate the movement of qualified prospects through the development pipeline. Read more School of Nursing - Assistant/Associate Professor 10004291 On Site Fairfax, VA College of Public Health Instructional Faculty Faculty contribute to the mission of the School of Nursing through innovative and impactful education, research, and service. The School of Nursing - Assistant/Associate Professor serves as teaching-intensive faculty across nursing school curricula, depending upon the area of their expertise and the needs of the school. Priority consideration is given to individuals with background or experience in Med/Surg, Critical Care, or Maternal/Child Health. Read more Compost Coordinator 10004514 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Facilities & Campus Operations Classified Staff Join George Mason University as a Composting Program Coordinator and lead campus-wide food waste diversion, compost operations, and sustainability initiatives.\n\nDrive compost program expansion through strategic planning, stakeholder engagement, compliance monitoring, training, and continuous process improvement.\nMake a measurable environmental impact by partnering with campus departments, vendors, and community organizations to advance food rescue and composting goals. Read more Director, Financial Analysis & Cost Management Accounting 10003950 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Fiscal Services Administrative or Professional Faculty Closing on: Sep 9 2026 George Mason University's Controllers Office is looking for a Director of Financial Analysis and Cost Management. Read more Part-Time Event Production Coordinator 10004511 On Site Arlington, VA Facilities & Campus Operations Part-Time / Hourly Wage The Mason Square Office of Events Management is seeking part-time Event Production Coordinators who focus on setting up and operating A/V event equipment, leading support staff, troubleshooting technical issues, and assisting Event Managers. The position requires strong customer service skills, a flexible schedule, and A/V knowledge or willingness to learn. Read more Records Center Assistant 10004497 On Site Fairfax, VA Library Part-Time / Hourly Wage Closing on: Sep 11 2026 Join the University Records Management team at George Mason University! This part-time role supports warehouse operations, including inventory, records management, and campus pickups/deliveries, while building organizational and customer service skills. Read more Dean of Admissions 10004487 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Division of Enrollment Management Administrative or Professional Faculty Reporting to the SVP for Enrollment and Student Achievement, the Dean of Admissions leads undergraduate and graduate admissions, driving recruitment, evaluation, and enrollment of a diverse, talented, academically prepared student body. Read more Research Engineer: Systems Engineering and Software Development 10004483 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Col of Engineering and Computing Research Staff The George Mason C5I Center, within the Volgenau School of Engineering under the College of Engineering and Computing (CEC), seeks a proactive, organized, and self-reliant Systems Engineering Research Engineer to develop a Digital Engineering prototype system. Read more Police Sergeant 10004470 On Site Fairfax, VA Executive Administration Classified Staff Closing on: Sep 12 2026 The George Mason University Police Department invites qualified applicants for the position of Police Sergeant, who will Lead and supervise police personnel in providing professional, community-focused law enforcement and public safety services that support George Mason University’s mission of maintaining a safe and secure environment for students, faculty, staff, and guests. Read more Police Lieutenant 10004472 On Site Fairfax, VA Executive Administration Classified Staff The George Mason University Police Department invites qualified applicants to apply for the position of Police Lieutenant, who will lead and supervise personnel, including Police Sergeants, in providing professional, community-focused law enforcement and public safety services that support George Mason University’s mission of maintaining a safe and secure environment for students, faculty, staff, and guests. Read more Catalog and Curriculum Specialist 10004484 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Division of Enrollment Management Classified Staff The Office of the University Registrar invites applications for the position of Catalog and Curriculum Specialist. This position is responsible for course and program inventory maintenance and participation in the annual publication process of the University Catalog. The Catalog and Curriculum Specialist is expected to leverage extensive breadth and depth of knowledge of George Mason University curricular policies and procedures to manage the curriculum approval process and provide outstanding customer service to our university partners. Read more Senior Event and Client Experience Manager 10004418 Hybrid Arlington, VA Facilities & Campus Operations Classified Staff The Senior Event and Client Experience Manager leads premier executive conferences, presidential engagements, academic convenings, and high-profile institutional events while driving operational excellence, client satisfaction, and revenue growth. This leadership role oversees event strategy, service innovation, performance metrics, AI-enabled process improvements, and team development to deliver exceptional experiences. Ideal candidates bring 7-10+ years of executive event management experience, strong stakeholder engagement skills, and a proven track record of leading complex operations in a fast-paced, customer-focused environment. Read more Academic Advisor - CYSE 10004485 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Col of Engineering and Computing Classified Staff The Department of Cyber Security Engineering at George Mason University, located in Fairfax, Virginia, near Washington, D.C., is looking for an Academic Advisor. The advisor would provide comprehensive academic advising and student support for undergraduate, graduate, and prospective students in the Department of Cyber Security Engineering. The advisor helps students interpret and apply university and departmental policies, develop academic plans, monitor progress toward degree completion, and connect with campus resources that support academic and professional success. The position also develops and delivers programs that promote student engagement, retention, and timely graduation.\n\nThe Academic Advisor serves as a trusted resource and partner in helping students achieve their academic, personal, and professional goals. Read more Senior Vice President and Chief Financial Officer (SVP and CFO) 10004479 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Executive Administration Administrative or Professional Faculty The CFO leads the Fiscal Services division of approximately 100 staff and works through the senior leaders of its units to deliver accounting and financial reporting, budgeting and forecasting, treasury and debt, internal controls and compliance, purchasing and procurement, accounts payable, payroll, and student accounts. Read more Budget & Financial Data Analyst 10004481 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Fiscal Services Classified Staff This position reports the Manager of Data Analytics by providing support for multiple business processes including budget model development, forecasting models/methodologies, and report development. Read more Administrative Assistant 10004475 On Site Fairfax, VA Col of Engineering and Computing Part-Time / Hourly Wage The George Mason University Dean’s Office, within the College of Engineering and Computing, seeks a proactive, organized, and self-reliant Administrative Assistant. Read more Administrative Associate 10004439 On Site Fairfax, VA Costello College of Business Classified Staff The Costello College of Business at George Mason University invites applications for the position of Administrative Associate. Two Administrative Associates will be hired from this recruitment, with one position supporting the Accounting area and the other supporting the Information Systems and Operations Management area. Read more Senior Buyer 10004403 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Fiscal Services Classified Staff The George Mason University Fiscal Services' Purchasing Department is hiring an experienced procurement professional to serve as a Senior Buyer. Read more Office Manager 10004468 Hybrid Fairfax, VA Col of Humanities and Soc Science Classified Staff The George Mason University Institute for Immigration Research (IIR) seeks a full time Office Manager to provide operational and administrative support. This position coordinates with the College of Humanities and Social Sciences (CHSS) HR team to assist with research staff, part-time and graduate student hiring, and assists with onboarding of new staff; supports the Director with financial management of all center funds including budgeting, forecasting, and Advisory Board reporting; offers guidance and support to graduate and undergraduate students in IIR related tasks; provides IIR sponsored event coordination support; manages equipment and the annual equipment inventory process; serves as the point of contact for all purchasing needs within the office (P-Card, eVA, etc.); and serves as the technical point of contact and telecom coordinator. Read more Senior Director, Technology Transfer 10004465 On Site Fairfax, VA Office Rsrch Innov and Econ Impact Administrative or Professional Faculty George Mason University is seeking a Senior Director to lead the Office of Technology Transfer, and the University’s efforts to facilitate the transfer of research discoveries and innovations for public use and benefit. Read more Admissions Assistant 10004464 On Site Arlington, VA Antonin Scalia Law School Part-Time / Hourly Wage The Admissions Assistant offers administrative and front-office support to the JD Admissions Office, handling inquiries from prospective students, applicants, admitted students, and visitors. This is a temporary, part-time position designed to provide additional administrative and front-office support to the JD Admissions Office during a period of staffing transition. The initial employment is temporary, however, may be extended under departmental needs and funding. The Admissions Assistant will handle front desk duties, provide administrative support to the Associate Dean for Admissions and Enrollment Management, assist with purchasing, organize admissions events, manage Student Ambassadors, and oversee daily office operations. Read more Fiscal Administrator 10004454 Remote Fairfax, VA Col of Ed and Human Development Classified Staff The Fiscal Administrator provides comprehensive fiscal support services and is responsible for the management and oversight of the fiscal operations of the department. This position supports a wide range of financial, travel, procurement, and revenue-related transactions, and handles department inventory, facilities, space, compliance, and risk management. The Fiscal Administrator ensures accuracy, timeliness, and compliance with university, state, college, and departmental policies while supporting faculty, staff, programmatic operations, and departmental activities. The role plays a key part in budget development, financial planning and management to ensure sound fiscal stewardship and compliance with university, state, and federal policies and procedures. Read more Admissions Operations Assistant 10004459 On Site Fairfax, VA Division of Enrollment Management Part-Time / Hourly Wage George Mason University Office of Admissions is seeking a dynamic, self-motivated, results-oriented individual to fill the position of Admissions Operations Assistant. Read more Business Analyst 10004409 Hybrid Fairfax, VA UL Classified Staff The Business Analyst (BA) position serves as a liaison between the Residential Services Assignments team and Housing Residence Life Finance team ensuring the accurate flow of residential student occupancy and billing data reflects on Mason finance systems. Read more Associate Dean for Faculty Affairs 10004456 Hybrid Fairfax, VA College of Science Administrative or Professional Faculty The Associate Dean for Faculty Affairs provides leadership, oversight, and strategic direction for matters related to faculty within the College of Science, including recruitment, appointment, promotion and tenure, professional development, mentoring, evaluation, and faculty success initiatives. Read more Displaying 1 - 30 of 140 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 › Powered by PageUp Equal Opportunity Consistent with its obligations under the law, GMU will provide reasonable accommodation to any employee with a disability who requires accommodation to perform the essential functions of the job. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Categories Accounting Careers Technology Careers Education Careers Administration Careers Recruiting Careers Quick Links About Us Contact Us Contribute Privacy Policy Sitemap Copyright © 2026 All Rights Reserved by GMU . | Cookie Preferences Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recommendations, and to analyze our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. I do not accept I accept"
